      en: ["Datong is consistently ranked as one of the largest coal producers in China.", "Jinneng Holding Group serves as the primary operator in the local mining sector.", "Linked to the Daqin Railway, which handles over 400 million tons of coal annually.", "Estimated coal reserves in the region run into several billion tons.", "Home to the world's first panda-shaped solar farm as part of its energy transition.", "The implementation of 'smart mining' technology has drastically improved safety."],
